   "text": "University of Vaasa - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nUniversity of Vaasa\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nThe University of Vaasa is focused on responsible business. The core competence of the University of Vaasa consists of high-level expertise in business, technology, management, and communications. We continuously accelerate and advance our operations with the help of our multidisciplinary research platforms. We are located at the heart of Northern Europe’s largest energy and environment business cluster. Renewal of the energy sector as a means to combat climate change is the core of our mission.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n26/03/2026 08:39\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n26/03/2026 08:39\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nFinland\nYearly Fees\nMax: €12,000.00\nMin: €10,000.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n5%\n250 of 5,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1968\nCampus(es)\nVaasa\nCountry\nFinland\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n16/11/2023\nContract End Date\n01/01/2036\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nhttps://www.uwasa.fi/en/education/studying-and-living-finland/information-about-vaasa/accommodation-vaasa\nScholarship Offered\nhttps://www.uwasa.fi/en/education/masters-programmes/tuition-fees-and-scholarships\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9Vbop7-NLds\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
